     "en": "This is a poem to recite. The child goes out in the garden on a fine day to play.\nWith a ball the child does actions: bounce, throw and catch.\nIn the next part the child plays with a kite.\nAction words in the poem tell what the child does: bounce, throw, catch and fly.\nSay the poem with actions to enjoy it more.\nA garden is a great place to play, if we also take care of the plants."
